nd native-renderer proof are not merchant fulfillment; no upstream proposal.</td></tr><tr><td>Payments v0.5.0 / Ship v0.3.1</td><td>Signed Registry Payments v0.5.0, Ship v0.3.1 and Commerce v0.8.0 installed through EmDash. Build-time overrides are removed; Commerce and Payments completed hosted consent. Fresh native Payments checks and a hosted TEST purchase are verified; Ship is connected with verified hosted sandbox labels. Local transports are stopped/disabled; their fixture proofs are historical, not hosted fulfillment.</td></tr></tbody></table></section>}
